nd="00:10.270">You</span><span begin="00:10.360" end="00:10.470"> can't</span><span begin="00:10.530" end="00:10.690"> get</span><span begin="00:10.770" end="00:10.920"> off</span><span begin="00:11.030" end="00:11.310"> your</span><span begin="00:11.460" end="00:12.960"> mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.970" end="00:15.650"><span begin="00:12.970" end="00:13.080">You</span><span begin="00:13.160" end="00:13.340"> get</span><span begin="00:13.420" end="00:13.830"> off</span><span begin="00:13.960" end="00:14.130"> on</span><span begin="00:14.220" end="00:14.550"> this</span><span begin="00:14.680" end="00:15.650"> obsession</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.650" end="00:18.480"><span begin="00:15.650" end="00:15.900">Does</span><span begin="00:15.970" end="00:16.020"> it</span><span begin="00:16.130" end="00:16.270"> cut</span><span begin="00:16.330" end="00:16.520"> you</span><span begin="00:16.610" end="00:16.870"> like</span><span begin="00:16.990" end="00:17.100"> a</span><span begin="00:17.190" end="00:18.480"> knife?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.480" end="00:21.230"><span begin="00:18.480" end="00:18.750">'Cause</span><span begin="00:18.790" end="00:18.990"> you</span><span begin="00:19.070" end="00:19.360"> never</span><span begin="00:19.460" end="00:19.810"> learn</span><span begin="00:19.920" end="00:20.190"> your</span><span begin="00:20.340" end="00:21.230"> lesson</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.230" end="00:24.820"><span begin="00:21.230" end="00:21.290">Well,</span><span begin="00:21.320" end="00:21.340"> I</span><span begin="00:21.420" end="00:21.800"> guess</span><span begin="00:21.850" end="00:22.210"> that's</span><span begin="00:22.330" end="00:22.560"> just</span><span begin="00:22.620" end="00:22.940"> my</span><span begin="00:23.020" end="00:23.330"> type,</span><span begin="00:23.680" end="00:24.820"> mm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.820" end="00:30.020"><span begin="00:24.820" end="00:25.160">You're</span><span begin="00:25.480" end="00:25.870"> not</span><span begin="00:26.120" end="00:26.400"> in</span><span begin="00:26.640" end="00:26.970"> my</span><span begin="00:27.190" end="00:28.690"> dreams</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.020" end="00:31.520"><span begin="00:30.020" end="00:30.250">But</span><span begin="00:30.340" end="00:30.500"> your</span><span begin="00:30.550" end="00:30.840"> mind's</span><span begin="00:30.910" end="00:31.020"> on</span><span begin="00:31.070" end="00:31.170"> my</span><span begin="00:31.180" end="00:31.680"> body</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.280" end="00:32.780"><span begin="00:31.280" end="00:31.420">And</span><span begin="00:31.490" end="00:31.510"> I</span><span begin="00:31.550" end="00:31.810"> might</span><span begin="00:31.880" end="00:32.070"> let</span><span begin="00:32.150" end="00:32.260"> ya</span><span begin="00:32.340" end="00:32.520"> have</span><span begin="00:32.540" end="00:33.040"> it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.670" end="00:35.740"><span begin="00:32.670" end="00:32.730">But</span><span begin="00:32.760" end="00:32.840"> you</span><span begin="00:32.870" end="00:33.020"> don't</span><span begin="00:33.080" end="00:33.280"> mean</span><span begin="00:33.330" end="00:33.370"> a</span><span begin="00:33.420" end="00:33.660"> thing</span><span begin="00:33.730" end="00:33.850"> to</span><span begin="00:33.920" end="00:35.420"> me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.740" end="00:40.860"><span begin="00:35.740" end="00:36.360">You're</span><span begin="00:36.450" end="00:36.670"> not</span><span begin="00:36.730" end="00:36.930"> in</span><span begin="00:37.650" end="00:38.090"> my</span><span begin="00:38.190" end="00:39.690"> dreams</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.860" end="00:42.360"><span begin="00:40.860" end="00:40.960">But</span><span begin="00:41.100" end="00:41.280"> your</span><span begin="00:41.340" end="00:41.690"> mind's</span><span begin="00