"> -</span><span begin="00:52.570" end="00:54.070"> in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.270" end="00:56.830"><span begin="00:54.270" end="00:54.300">I</span><span begin="00:54.360" end="00:54.640"> wanna</span><span begin="00:54.750" end="00:54.910"> see</span><span begin="00:55.000" end="00:55.190"> you</span><span begin="00:55.250" end="00:55.400"> on</span><span begin="00:55.490" end="00:55.750"> your</span><span begin="00:55.860" end="00:56.830"> knees</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.830" end="00:59.780"><span begin="00:56.830" end="00:57.080">You</span><span begin="00:57.130" end="00:57.280"> get</span><span begin="00:57.340" end="00:57.550"> off</span><span begin="00:57.680" end="00:57.940"> on</span><span begin="00:58.140" end="00:58.360"> this</span><span begin="00:58.490" end="00:59.780"> obsession</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.780" end="01:02.510"><span begin="00:59.780" end="01:00.030">Does</span><span begin="01:00.110" end="01:00.180"> it</span><span begin="01:00.310" end="01:00.460"> cut</span><span begin="01:00.530" end="01:00.820"> you</span><span begin="01:00.930" end="01:01.210"> like</span><span begin="01:01.330" end="01:01.430"> a</span><span begin="01:01.540" end="01:02.510"> knife?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.510" end="01:05.550"><span begin="01:02.510" end="01:02.750">'Cause</span><span begin="01:02.830" end="01:03.170"> you</span><span begin="01:03.250" end="01:03.660"> never</span><span begin="01:03.880" end="01:04.170"> learn</span><span begin="01:04.250" end="01:04.440"> your</span><span begin="01:04.510" end="01:05.550"> lesson</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.550" end="01:08.810"><span begin="01:05.550" end="01:05.810">Well,</span><span begin="01:05.850" end="01:05.860"> I</span><span begin="01:05.890" end="01:06.110"> guess</span><span begin="01:06.260" end="01:06.440"> that's</span><span begin="01:06.490" end="01:06.570"> just</span><span begin="01:06.630" end="01:06.740"> my</span><span begin="01:06.800" end="01:07.270"> type,</span><span begin="01:07.660" end="01:08.810"> mm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.810" end="01:13.910"><span begin="01:08.810" end="01:09.410">You're</span><span begin="01:09.580" end="01:09.740"> not</span><span begin="01:10.070" end="01:10.330"> in</span><span begin="01:10.700" end="01:10.960"> my</span><span begin="01:11.070" end="01:12.570"> dreams</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.910" end="01:15.410"><span begin="01:13.910" end="01:14.080">But</span><span begin="01:14.190" end="01:14.320"> your</span><span begin="01:14.380" end="01:14.670"> mind's</span><span begin="01:14.740" end="01:14.840"> on</span><span begin="01:14.890" end="01:14.980"> my</span><span begin="01:15.010" end="01:15.510"> body</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.370" end="01:16.870"><span begin="01:15.370" end="01:15.520">And</span><span begin="01:15.550" end="01:15.570"> I</span><span begin="01:15.620" end="01:15.900"> might</span><span begin="01:16.020" end="01:16.080"> let</span><span begin="01:16.130" end="01:16.240"> ya</span><span begin="01:16.290" end="01:16.470"> have</span><span begin="01:16.500" end="01:17.000"> it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.560" end="01:19.950"><span begin="01:16.560" end="01:16.590">But</span><span begin="01:16.610" end="01:16.810"> you</span><span begin="01:16.840" end="01:17.000"> don't</span><span begin="01:17.060" end="01:17.270"> mean</span><span begin="01:17.300" end="01:17.330"> a</span><span begin="01:17.360" end="01:17.530"> thing</span><span begin="01:17.620" end="01:17.740"> to</span><span begin="01:17.800" end="01:19.300"> me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.950" end="01:25.010"><span begin="01:19.950" end="01:20.400">You're</span><span begin="01:20.840" end="01:21.210"> not</span><span begin="01:21.470" end="01:21.740"> in</span><span begin="01:22.010" end="01:22.320"> my</span><span begin="01:22.410" end="01:23.910"> dreams</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.0